# Account (optional). Copy this file to .env.local and fill in both values to turn on
# Sign in with Apple and the account save. Leave them empty and the game is the
# guest game only: the save stays on the device and Settings says accounts
# aren't set up in this build.
#
# From the Supabase dashboard: Project Settings > API (Data API URL and the
# publishable key, which starts with sb_publishable_). Never put a secret or
# service_role key here: every EXPO_PUBLIC_ value is built into the app.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
